 pve-qemu-kvm (11.1.3-4) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * fix #8343, #8361: avoid QMP timeouts and VM stalls in PBS backups of RBD
     disks. The recently introduced parallel processing of chunks for PBS
     backup Server did not play nice with librbd waiting for in-flight requests
     when checking the allocation status (reported in Bugzilla issue #7909).
     Use a separate worker thread for these potentially long-running queries.
 
